{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-04_beg","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-04","title":"火种，一触即灭","storyCode":"R8-4","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"1b240580abaef667538949271e0a863d2d7ccc0e3932c98752ab4b235fbd388e","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"塔露拉拜访被逼到绝境的平民感染者，感染者纠察队此时也找上门来，双方冲突一触即发。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"晖洁：\n老爷爷，根据我那点不怎么牢靠的记忆，是叫伊万·伊贾斯拉夫。\n是个很常见的名字。他也是个随处可见的农民。\n但他牺牲了自己。出于种种，他牺牲了自己的性命......\n我偶尔会想，我是不是真的值得别人牺牲性命？\n阿丽娜随我一起行动。这个人虽然大多时候都很柔和，有时候却突然地尖酸起来，让我感觉很不舒服。\n计划顺利地推进着。\n按照我的想法，很快，这一部分的感染者，一定会团结起来。\n希望这确实有效。\n也希望爷爷能够安眠。除了老奶奶，我没有比他更亲的亲人。\n2月7日"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_iceforest_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"脱离黑蛇第三年"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，我是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你来这干什么？你这身衣服，你是哪的军官老爷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"回去吧！这里已经啥都不剩了。全被你们抢走了！你们抢不走的，还都烧光了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"混蛋！你来是要杀我吗？那你就杀吧！你们这些天杀的恶鬼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不，先生，我是来告诉你，感染者纠察队今天会来这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"那让他们来吧，让他们杀了我们吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在这么偏的地方建了个几乎不能住人的村子，他们还要来！那就只能让他们来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你可以藏好，让我和他们说话。或者我藏起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你又是谁？我说了，你们这种军官贵族，不论装成什么样！都只是想要我们把命——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你可能和他们不一样，因为你居然愿意和我们说话！他们可是连用鞭子抽我们都嫌烦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"消失了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"这又是什么骗局？哎......我们的命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的命也就这点程度。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"对自己的命有认知也是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......纠察队老爷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"......又穷又破。体格也很差。送军队矿场去也没什么油水赚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你是要怎么个死法？痛快的还是慢慢的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......老爷！你看我这样，留我一命对你们没什么坏处！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"手上拿着武器，还在说这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起，老爷！这是用来对付刚才那个家伙的！她现在不知道跑哪去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者比驮兽还不如。驮兽还能装运货物，你们活着只是浪费陛下的土地！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你是哪来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"从很远的东方来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么东西......你，也是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我能思想，也能说话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们感染者有生有死，这生死为什么要你来定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"说什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能给我们一个安稳的场合自行死去，我们甚至都不会有这么愤怒......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，感染者兄弟，抬起头来看看！看看他的眼神，他的嘴，他的笑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"他们想决定我们怎么死，他们想操控我们。也许我们的命不值几个钱，但你难道就能值一枚金币？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"兄弟，在他们以前的暴行里，他们有因为谁态度好就放过谁吗，有因为别人做得对就让他们活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"不对！他们以前让你们活着，只是因为你们还有油水可榨！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"当你们没了钱没了土地，他们就会把你们一脚踢开，因为在城市里，感染者甚至都不能活下去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"我们感染者，怎么活，怎么死，只该我们自己决定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_094","isRemote":false,"text":"你......究竟是谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"混账东西！你叫什么名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者纠察队","speakerId":"avg_npc_082","isRemote":false,"text":"以皇帝的名义！居然用这些歪理邪说蛊惑他的子民，我们这就处死你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"对于兄弟们，我是没有名字的。你们想怎么叫我都可以，如果一定要叫名字，你们可以叫我塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"对于敌人，你们不需要知道我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_078","isRemote":false,"text":"但我的火会点燃你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
